            "review_title": "Review at MTea Trà Quán",
            "review_text": "Kim Loan\nDa Nang, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nThe special Vietnam Tradional in Danang\nMay 2021 • Friends\nI found this place on my walking. It's right in the city center. There's so many kind of Vietnam Traditional tea here. Everything was perfect. First time I may know clear about Tea. The taste is so good. I'll back several time to enjoy all kind of tea here. Highly recommed!\nWritten July 1, 2021",
